{"id":1768,"date":"2026-08-04T08:19:09","date_gmt":"2026-08-04T02:19:09","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/cutestoryevents.com\/?page_id=1768"},"modified":"2026-08-04T08:57:08","modified_gmt":"2026-08-04T02:57:08","slug":"seattle-tacoma-event-planner","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/cutestoryevents.com\/seattle-tacoma-event-planner\/","title":{"rendered":"Seattle &amp; Tacoma Event Planner for Corporate, Nonprofit, and Community Events"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Seattle &amp; Tacoma Event Planner for Corporate, Nonprofit, and Community Events<\/h1>\n\n\n\n<p>Looking for an event planner in Seattle who actually shows up in person? Cute Story Events plans and manages events throughout the Puget Sound \u2014 Seattle, Tacoma, and everywhere in between. Whether you&#8217;re hosting a corporate conference, a nonprofit fundraiser, or a community gathering, we handle the details so you don&#8217;t have to. With 15+ years of experience planning everything from SXSW-scale productions to intimate dinners, we bring big-event expertise to your local event.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Event Planning Services in Seattle &amp; Tacoma<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>We plan and manage in-person, virtual, and hybrid events for organizations across the region, including:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Corporate conferences and meetings<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Nonprofit fundraisers and galas<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Community events and festivals<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Product launches and brand activations<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Speaker, vendor, and sponsor coordination<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Why Local Businesses Choose Cute Story Events<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Hiring a local event planner means someone who knows the venues, vendors, and logistics of the Puget Sound firsthand \u2014 not a generic checklist. We&#8217;ve worked with clients like the Philadelphia Film Festival and Hilton Hotels, and we bring that same level of organization and care to every Seattle and Tacoma event. Good events take time to do right, and we&#8217;re committed to honest communication from first call to final cleanup.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Areas We Serve<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Based in Tacoma, we plan events throughout: Seattle, Tacoma, Bellevue, Federal Way, Puyallup, Olympia, and the greater Puget Sound region.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Let&#8217;s Plan Your Event<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Ready to bring your Seattle or Tacoma event to life? Get in touch and let&#8217;s talk about what you&#8217;re planning.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/cutestoryevents.com\/connect\/\">Contact Us!<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Seattle &amp; Tacoma Event Planner for Corporate, Nonprofit, and Community Events Looking for an event planner in Seattle who actually [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":3,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_uag_custom_page_level_css":"","site-sidebar-layout":"default","site-content-layout":"","ast-site-content-layout":"default","site-content-style":"default","site-sidebar-style":"default","ast-global-header-display":"","ast-banner-title-visibility":"","ast-main-header-display":"","ast-hfb-above-header-display":"","ast-hfb-below-header-display":"","ast-hfb-mobile-header-display":"","site-post-title":"","ast-breadcrumbs-content":"","ast-featured-img":"","footer-sml-layout":"","ast-disable-related-posts":"","theme-transparent-header-meta":"","adv-header-id-meta":"","stick-header-meta":"","header-above-stick-meta":"","header-main-stick-meta":"","header-below-stick-meta":"","as